 Play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Roll the word die and read the word.</li>\n<li>Use your hand to 'splat' the card with the correct rule for adding 'ing' to the word.</li>\n<li>The player who splats first wins the word (if they are correct).</li>\n<li>Write down the word with 'ing' added using the spelling rule.</li>\n<li>The winner is the first player with ten words written in their list.</li>\n</ol>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 54212298, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 56520677, "text": "<h2>You Will Need:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A set of spelling rule cards - use the picture below to make your cards!</li>\n<li>A piece of paper each to write your word list on.</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 54212298, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fon